  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdd the missing `edit_tool` row beside `add_tool` in the MCP skill.\nDescribe its parameters, partial ToolDto, merge-patch rules, response, undo, staleness and refusals.\nRecord the decision in `docs/decisions/1343-edit-tool-skill.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe tool shipped without its reference row.\nThe existing plasma example mentions one refusal but does not document the general contract.\n\n## Tests\n\nThe temporary documentation pin `EditToolSkillPin.test_edit_tool_reference_contract` checks the dedicated tooling row and its contract fields.\nIt failed on unchanged upstream/main a529c4553 before the fix.\nIt passes with the new row.\nMutation: copy the skill from `git show upstream/main:.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` over the fixed file; the pin fails.\nRestore the fixed skill; the pin passes again.\nThe pin and its logs stay outside the PR tree.\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed with zero selected steps for two Markdown changes.\n`git diff --check` passed.\nClippy does not apply because no Rust crate changed.\nEach diff hunk was checked against the shipped schema and implementation or the decision-record rule.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nRuntime MCP tests, the GUI, and physical machines were not exercised.\nThis PR changes documentation only.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPRs #2187, #2149, #2136 and #2134 touch the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\nThey document fixture turning, protected geometry, post options and DXF tools.\nNone changes the `edit_tool` reference row.\nThis branch starts from upstream/main a529c4553.\n\nChangelog: Document the shipped edit_tool MCP parameters, undo behaviour and refusals in the agent skill.\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nEffort: low\n\nFixes #1343\n",
